@VidreriaGarmendia_HostAddress = http://localhost:5295

### Consultar contactos
GET {{VidreriaGarmendia_HostAddress}}/api/contactos
Accept: application/json

### Guardar contacto
POST {{VidreriaGarmendia_HostAddress}}/api/contactos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Perez",
  "correo": "juan@gmail.com",
  "telefono": "88888888",
  "mensaje": "Solicito información"
}
